<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><%- include('../partials/business-head') %><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"></head><body><%- include('../partials/header') %><main class="studio-page"><h1>Course Booking Received</h1><p>Reference: <%= item._id %></p><h2><%= item.course_name %></h2><p>Status: <strong><%= item.status %></strong></p><p>Preferred schedule: <%= item.preferred_date %> at <%= item.preferred_time %> IST · <%= item.mode %></p><p>We will contact you using the submitted details to discuss availability. This request does not take payment or guarantee the requested schedule.</p><p>Keep this reference. This page is accessible in the browser used to submit your booking.</p><% if(canVisit('/courses')){ %><a href="/courses">Explore Courses</a><% } %></main><%- include('../partials/footer') %><script src="/js/main.js"></script></body></html>
